  Slug: waxing-moon-sarangay
  DisplayName: Waxing Moon Sarangay
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: Your ancestors dwelled in the swamps, fens, and flooded forests, where
    they contended with fierce predators and formed raiding parties to claim scarce
    resources. Blessed by the growing crescent, you're one of the eviscerators, and
    you can overcome threats that lurk in murky waters as well as those that hunt
    on land. You're a powerful swimmer with brown or gray fur and backward- or downward-curving
    horns. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Athletics checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Long
    Jump] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Swim].
